paragraph
  text "A "
  code "code span"
  text " and "
  code "two"
  text " of them. Two backquotes `` are no span. Here `"
  code "x"
  text " the second backquote starts one. A `split span` is none: code spans do not cross lines. "
  code "terse:0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef"
  text " is code, not a link. A lone ` backquote."
